    Bug 1978176 - Fix some clippy pedantic warnings. r=babolivier


    I looked through some (but nowhere near all) of the pedantic warnings, and
    fixed the ones that stood out. Unlike most of these clean ups, this commit
    actually fixes a couple minor bugs.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D288808

